                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "priestcrafts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc7bebe9-811d-3b4d-b8cd-d7173d54ecab",
                        "entry_id": "606cc058-a551-3878-b25e-2121ba57ed41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The craft of performing the duties of a priest."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3633ced-8280-49ac-860c-581a402a8388",
                                "sense_id": "dc7bebe9-811d-3b4d-b8cd-d7173d54ecab",
                                "text": "One of the most complex of all the poems in the mythological cycle is \"Inanna's Descent into the Nether World.\" This work does not have the air of a dairymaid's song but rather seems to be an expression of priestcraft, astrology, and an investigation into the nature of time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c859193-4fa1-474f-acd5-36fae5904b87",
                                "sense_id": "dc7bebe9-811d-3b4d-b8cd-d7173d54ecab",
                                "text": "Whilst caring for a congregation is fundamental, it is a long way from being the only tool in the priestcraft toolbox."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0438b6b-6aea-3d1b-9b75-b6218874da25",
                        "entry_id": "606cc058-a551-3878-b25e-2121ba57ed41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Priestly policy directed towards worldly ends."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34e58fe1-70f5-46d0-8793-b88c20a80fb3",
                                "sense_id": "f0438b6b-6aea-3d1b-9b75-b6218874da25",
                                "text": "In pious times, ere priestcraft did begin, before polygamy was made a sin"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87fb92ce-155f-4972-99f5-e37eca20a3ba",
                                "sense_id": "f0438b6b-6aea-3d1b-9b75-b6218874da25",
                                "text": "He commandeth that there shall be no priestcrafts; for, behold, priestcrafts are that men preach and set themselves up for a light unto the world, that they may get gain and praise of the world; but they seek not the welfare of Zion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7c7aa6e-23cf-4be1-a2f7-b612323a4a31",
                                "sense_id": "f0438b6b-6aea-3d1b-9b75-b6218874da25",
                                "text": "Perhaps thou wert a priest,--if so, my struggles / Are vain, for priestcraft never owns its juggles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
